msgid "BUY_WAGON_GUIDE_NAME"
msgstr "Buy a Wagon"

msgid "BUY_WAGON_GUIDE_PARAGRAPH"
msgstr ""
"In the vehicle store you can buy vehicles to transport cargo and passengers. "
"There are several different stores in Transport Fever 3, one for each "
"transport type, such as road vehicles, trams, trains, ships, airplanes, and "
"helicopters. To easily find a vehicle that suits your purpose, use the "
"filter bar to filter vehicles suited for transporting a specific kind of "
"cargo or passengers. After selecting a vehicle on the left, you can see the "
"vehicle details on the right-hand side, including the capacity, speed and "
"power of vehicles."

msgid "Bury St Edmunds"
msgstr "Bury St Edmunds"

msgid "Bury St Edmunds Brickworks"
msgstr "Bury St Edmunds Brickworks"

msgid "Bury St Edmunds Crop Farm"
msgstr "Bury St Edmunds Crop Farm"

msgid "Bury St Edmunds Logging Camp"
msgstr "Bury St Edmunds Logging Camp"

msgid "CAMERA_GUIDE_MOUSE_NAME"
msgstr "Camera Movement"

msgid "CAMERA_GUIDE_MOUSE_PARAGRAPH"
msgstr ""
"Hold the right mouse button and drag to pan the camera. Hold the middle "
"mouse button (scroll wheel) and drag to rotate the view, and use the scroll "
"wheel to zoom in and out."

msgid "CAMERA_GUIDE_XBOX_PARAGRAPH"
msgstr ""
"Use [iaHint=IA_CAMERA_PAN/] move the camera, [iaHint=IA_CAMERA_TILT/] to "
"tilt it and  [iaHint=IA_CAMERA_ROTATE_X/] to rotate it. Use "
"[iaHint=IA_CAMERA_ZOOM_OUT/] to zoom out and  [iaHint=IA_CAMERA_ZOOM_IN/] to "
"zoom in."

msgid "CAMPAIGN_DESC"
msgstr "Transport what moves the world!"

msgid "CAMPAIGN_DISCLAIMER"
msgstr ""
"The campaigns aim to portray key milestones in the history of transportation "
"as vividly as possible in their historical context.\n"
"They also deal with dark chapters in the world’s events, whereby the "
"corresponding episodes are never supposed to be downplayed, and the victims "
"within them never ridiculed.\n"
"After all, it shouldn’t be left by the wayside that the history of "
"transportation was often and still is a story of conflicts, oppression, and "
"sometimes great suffering.\n"
"Accordingly, the value judgments conveyed in the individual missions do not "
"reflect the developers’ own values."

msgid "CAMPAIGN_MISSION_01_ASSETS_HOTEL_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The most famous hotel in New Orleans, a place where luxury meets the charm "
"of the French Quarter."

msgid "CAMPAIGN_MISSION_01_ASSETS_HOTEL_NAME"
msgstr "French Quarter Hotel"

msgid "CAMPAIGN_MISSION_01_ASSETS_HOTEL_UNDERCONSTRUCTION_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "The famous French Quarter Hotel is built here."

msgid "CAMPAIGN_MISSION_01_ASSETS_HOTEL_UNDERCONSTRUCTION_MESSAGE"
msgstr "Supply the required goods to the construction site."

