msgid "LANDMARK_ARENA_OF_VERONA_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Once the stage for epic spectacles, the colossal amphitheater now rests in "
"silent dignity, embodying enduring strength and grand performances.\n"
"\n"
"Reduces noise from road vehicles within the municipal area."

msgid "LANDMARK_ARENA_OF_VERONA_NAME"
msgstr "Amphitheater"

msgid "LANDMARK_EIFFEL_TOWER_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The Eiffel Tower, a timeless icon of innovation and engineering. From the "
"top of this imposing masterpiece, one can overlook the entire region.\n"
"\n"
"Increases speed of road vehicles within the municipal area."

msgid "LANDMARK_EIFFEL_TOWER_NAME"
msgstr "Eiffel Tower"

msgid "LANDMARK_GREATPYRAMID_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Constructed from millions of tons of stone blocks, the pyramid has defied "
"wind and weather for millennia, a monumental legacy of a great "
"civilization.\n"
"\n"
"Increases speed of trains within the municipal area."

msgid "LANDMARK_GREATPYRAMID_NAME"
msgstr "Great Pyramid"

msgid "LANDMARK_LIGHTHOUSE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The great lighthouse has guided generations of seafarers back to the safety "
"of the harbor. It defies wind and tides with unwavering resolve.\n"
"\n"
"Increases speed of water vehicles within the municipal area."

msgid "LANDMARK_LIGHTHOUSE_NAME"
msgstr "Great Lighthouse"

msgid "LANDMARK_NEUSCHWANSTEIN_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The world-famous castle majestically crowns green forests and hills. A model "
"for all fairy tale castles, it seems to have stepped right out of a dream.\n"
"\n"
"Increases comfort of road vehicles within the municipal area."

msgid "LANDMARK_NEUSCHWANSTEIN_NAME"
msgstr "Castle Neuschwanstein"

msgid "LANDMARK_OPERA_HOUSE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Magnificent and majestic, the opera house stands as a temple of music and "
"song. In every corner, the applause of the enchanted audience echoes.\n"
"\n"
"Increases comfort of trains within the municipal area."

msgid "LANDMARK_OPERA_HOUSE_NAME"
msgstr "Opera House"

msgid "LANDMARK_SHIP_MUSEUM_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"This historic ship, with weathered wood and towering masts, tells of the "
"relentless power of the sea. It is a tribute to the golden age of "
"seafaring.\n"
"\n"
"Increases comfort of water vehicles within the municipal area."

msgid "LANDMARK_SHIP_MUSEUM_NAME"
msgstr "Ship Museum"

msgid "LANDMARK_STATUE_OF_LIBERTY_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Rising like a beacon above the sea, the statue stands proudly. It is not "
"just a monument, but also a symbol of hospitality and freedom.\n"
"\n"
"Decreases pollution of water vehicles within the municipal area."

msgid "LANDMARK_STATUE_OF_LIBERTY_NAME"
msgstr "Statue of Liberty"

msgid "LANDMARK_SUMMER_PALACE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The palace embodies elegance and reverence in a breathtaking blend of "
"natural beauty and imperial grandeur.\n"
"\n"
"Decreases pollution of air vehicles within the municipal area."

msgid "LANDMARK_SUMMER_PALACE_NAME"
msgstr "Summer Palace"

msgid "LANDMARK_TAJMAHAL_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Clad in ivory marble and crowned by graceful domes, this building radiates "
"timeless elegance. It is a true symbol of eternal love.\n"
"\n"
"Reduces noise from air vehicles within the municipal area."

msgid "LANDMARK_TAJMAHAL_NAME"
msgstr "Taj Mahal"

msgid "LANDMARK_WESTMINSTER_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"With its striking Gothic architecture and iconic clock tower, this palace "
"outshines its surroundings and stands as a true symbol of determination.\n"
"\n"
"Increases speed of all vehicles within the municipal area."

msgid "LANDMARK_WESTMINSTER_NAME"
msgstr "Houses of Parliament"

msgid "LANDMARK_WHITE_HERON_CASTLE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"A masterpiece of Japanese architecture that unites tradition and power. It "
"is both an elegant palace and an impregnable fortress.\n"
"\n"
"Decreases pollution of trains within the municipal area."

msgid "LANDMARK_WHITE_HERON_CASTLE_NAME"
msgstr "White Heron Castle"

