msgstr "Assistant"

msgid "MISSION_01_CHARACTER_3_NAME"
msgstr "Andrew"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_BRIDGE_1"
msgstr ""
"At the moment, almost no tourists can make it into the city! After all, they "
"get here by train from Kenner."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_BRIDGE_2"
msgstr "And the bridge across the Mississippi there collapsed in the storm!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_BRIDGE_3"
msgstr ""
"As I mentioned before, we urgently need to rebuild it! Otherwise, this Mardi "
"Gras will be little more than an extended family reunion."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_BRIDGE_4"
msgstr "I actually agree with the mayor for once."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_BRIDGE_COMPLETE_1"
msgstr ""
"The train’s finally running again! How wonderful! The tourists bring in money"
"—and of course, they’re good for the city’s image too!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_BUILD_PATH_1"
msgstr "That’s one problem down—let’s see what’s next!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_BUILD_PATH_2"
msgstr ""
"We’re still cut off from the outside world. The road is sodden, washed away, "
"and eroded underneath. And there are fallen trees everywhere. You must have "
"machines for that kind of thing, right?"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_BUILD_PATH_COMPLETE_1"
msgstr "Done! The first step toward restoring normality."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_BUILD_PATH_COMPLETE_2"
msgstr ""
"Something you should know: The city depends on wealthy travelers! We’d "
"actually been planning to build another hotel, but the storm has left us "
"short on construction materials! And we need something New Orleans has never "
"had: a real luxury hotel! That’ll bring in the big bucks!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_BUILD_PATH_COMPLETE_3"
msgstr ""
"The hotel will be a feast for the eyes, a magnificent building that will "
"enhance the city’s reputation and its coffers as soon as the wood arrives at "
"the construction site. Andrew, can you take care of that again?"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_GUMBO_SHIP_1"
msgstr "Unfortunately, the fishermen’s boats were also swept into the Gulf."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_GUMBO_SHIP_2"
msgstr ""
"Many of the fish traps and nets were well-secured and survived the flood, "
"but the fishermen won’t be able to get their haul without a boat."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_GUMBO_SHIP_3"
msgstr ""
"Out east near Terrytown, they mostly fish for shrimp, while in the west near "
"the lumberjacks, they usually catch fish."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_HOTEL_FOOD_FISH_1"
msgstr ""
"You know, Katie cares about many things and has a big heart, but I have to "
"keep the budget balanced."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_HOTEL_FOOD_FISH_2"
msgstr ""
"Between the two of us: As a politician, I’m always trying to kill several "
"birds with one stone—three in this case: monetary and political capital, as "
"well as believe it or not, helping the poor."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_HOTEL_FOOD_FISH_3"
msgstr ""
"But please don’t tell my fellow party members the latter. Or Katie, for that "
"matter. Otherwise, she’ll think I’m trying to buy her."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_HOTEL_FOOD_FISH_4"
msgstr ""
"So, what’s this about? Fish! The hotel kitchens are serving British food. "
"For me, as a Frenchman—so to speak—yuck!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_HOTEL_FOOD_SHRIMPS_1"
msgstr ""
"You know, Katie cares about many things and has a big heart, but I have to "
"keep the budget balanced."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_HOTEL_FOOD_SHRIMPS_2"
msgstr ""
"Between the two of us: As a politician, I’m always trying to kill several "
"birds with one stone—three in this case: monetary and political capital, as "
"well as believe it or not, helping the poor."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_HOTEL_FOOD_SHRIMPS_3"
msgstr ""
"But please don’t tell my fellow party members the latter. Or Katie, for that "
"matter. Otherwise, she’ll think I’m trying to buy her."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_HOTEL_FOOD_SHRIMPS_4"
msgstr ""
"What’s this all about? Shrimp! The hotel kitchens cook British food. For me, "
"as a Frenchman—so to speak—yuck!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_INTRO_1"
msgstr ""
"Sorry, I should probably introduce myself first: My name’s Beauregard "
"LaFontaine, I’m the mayor of this city."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_INTRO_2"
msgstr ""
"Time is incredibly tight. I’m assigning my assistant to help you. He’s still "
"young, but he knows the city’s problems. He’ll get you up to speed on the "
"local situation, while I try to save our Mardi Gras. Oh, and by the way: "
"Welcome to the most vibrant city in the world!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_INTRO_3"
msgstr ""
"Hello! Call me Andrew. Just Andrew. The days of rainfall have caused the "
"Mississippi to spill over its banks, drawing a whole bunch of alligators out "
"of the bayou."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_LOGS_INTERMEZZO_1"
msgstr "If I may, I’d like to remind the mayor of his oath of office…"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_LOGS_INTERMEZZO_10"
msgstr "We want rich visitors. Rich visitors mean a rich city!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_LOGS_INTERMEZZO_2"
msgstr ""
"Allow me to introduce Katie Baker. To some, she’s the social consciousness "
"of the city."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_LOGS_INTERMEZZO_3"
msgstr ""
"Nice to meet you. I run the orphanage here and represent the Zulu Krewe."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_LOGS_INTERMEZZO_4"
msgstr "Zulu Krewe? What’s that again?"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_LOGS_INTERMEZZO_5"
msgstr ""
"A charity. We take care of orphans, seniors, the sick. It isn’t just about "
"luxury hotels. Mardi Gras is a festival for everyone!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_LOGS_INTERMEZZO_6"
msgstr ""
"Of course it is, but we do need the revenue from the hotels! Without it, "
"there’d be no community in the city!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_LOGS_INTERMEZZO_7"
msgstr ""
"Andrew, you know where both sides are coming from. Please try to talk some "
"sense into the mayor. He might actually listen to you."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_LOGS_INTERMEZZO_8"
msgstr ""
"Katie took me in after my parents died. She’s the voice of the little "
"people. You should take her seriously."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_LOGS_INTERMEZZO_9"
msgstr ""
"I do. But she has no idea what’s involved in the development of a city like "
"this! And my fellow party members eye me with suspicion just for talking to "
"her!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_MUSIC_1"
msgstr ""
"Those Good Old Cowboys are nothing more than pals of the mayor—out and out "
"amateurs. And all the while, there are dozens of amazing musicians living in "
"this city."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_MUSIC_2"
msgstr ""
"But most of them headed north after the storm to check on their parents."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_MUSIC_3"
msgstr ""
"Many young musicians in New Orleans come from farming and fishing families "
"in the bayou. Of course, they wanted to go check on their folks, see they "
"made it through the flooding all right."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_MUSIC_4"
msgstr "And now they’re not gonna get back in time."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_MUSIC_5"
msgstr ""
"Unless you can connect Lake Shore to the bus network, that is! It’s close "
"enough. They could easily walk there. And it would also give the residents "
"of Lake Shore the chance to go to Mardi Gras."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_MUSIC_6"
msgstr "Trust me: Music history will thank you for it! And the mayor’s budget!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_MUSIC_7"
msgstr "Which is the budget of the entire city!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_MUSIC_8"
msgstr "You’re right, Andrew. We just don’t see very much of it."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_MUSIC_COMPLETE_1"
msgstr "Where’s that caterwauling coming from all of a sudden? Did I order it?"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_MUSIC_COMPLETE_2"
msgstr ""
"Ragtime is out. This is a completely new kind of music, Mr. LaFontaine. The "
"cats from the bayou brought it with them. Cats, that’s what the musicians "
"call themselves. What did you call it? Caterwauling? How fitting!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_MUSIC_COMPLETE_3"
msgstr ""
"Caterwauling? That’ll never stick. But the music will! So bubbly, rousing. "
"Pure energy!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_MUSIC_COMPLETE_4"
msgstr "Maybe you should do something with music, Andrew!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_MUSIC_COMPLETE_5"
msgstr ""
"Well, I suppose I don’t have to understand why people like it. The main "
"thing is they’re having a good time!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_MUSIC_COMPLETE_6"
msgstr "And wallets seem to be a bit looser, wouldn’t you agree?"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_MUSIC_COMPLETE_7"
msgstr "That’s a little unfair, Miss Baker!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_MUSIC_COMPLETE_8"
msgstr "Just a little? Too bad!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_MUSIC_COMPLETE_9"
msgstr ""
"I don’t wish to argue with you, Miss Baker. We actually agree on more than "
"you’d care to admit. Looks like we’ve got pretty much everything in place "
"now."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_OUTRO_A_1"
msgstr "What a triumph for New Orleans!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_OUTRO_A_10"
msgstr ""
"Yes, when I was a boy. But… I felt bad for those listening. I can give it to "
"you if you like!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_OUTRO_A_11"
msgstr ""
"Thank you very much, Mr. Mayor. You’ve got to hear Louis! When he plays, the "
"misery of the world ceases for a while. You’ll understand!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_OUTRO_A_12"
msgstr "There’s one thing I’ve understood at least!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_OUTRO_A_13"
msgstr "That you’re lucky I gave you this job!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_OUTRO_A_14"
msgstr ""
"Yes, that too. But mostly that I want to do logistics. That’s my life! New "
"Orleans is too small. I want to see the world! New York! Europe! Asia!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_OUTRO_A_15"
msgstr "Europe? Asia? Why would you want to go there?"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_OUTRO_A_16"
msgstr "To build bridges, Mr. Mayor. To build bridges!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_OUTRO_A_2"
msgstr "I would have liked better catering for the hotel guests, though!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_OUTRO_A_3"
msgstr "It didn’t bother any of the locals."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_OUTRO_A_4"
msgstr ""
"But we’ve got the Good Old Cowboys to thank for making sure our guests got a "
"good night’s sleep."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_OUTRO_A_5"
msgstr ""
"Get used to it, Miss Baker. That caterwauling makes folks crazy! We don’t "
"want any uprisings here!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_OUTRO_A_6"
msgstr ""
"But there was a young boy in your krewe who caught my eye—he seemed really "
"talented!"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_OUTRO_A_7"
msgstr ""
"Louis? Yes, he’s one of my protégés and a really big talent. But he was just "
"borrowing the cornet. He doesn’t have one of his own yet. We’re collecting…"

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_OUTRO_A_8"
msgstr ""
"You waste as much heart as you do money, Miss Baker! But I think I still "
"have my old cornet up in the attic."

msgid "MISSION_01_CUTSCENE_OUTRO_A_9"
msgstr "You used to play the cornet? Really?"

