msgstr "GMC 660 DFM"

msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_HORSE_CART_BARRELS_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"For certain types of cargo, horse-drawn carts were often highly specialized, "
"with designs tailored to facilitate efficient loading and unloading."

msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_HORSE_CART_BARRELS_NAME"
msgstr "Horse Carriage with Barrels"

msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_HORSE_CART_MEDIUM_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"For larger types of cargo or to be able to transport more volume, larger "
"cargo carts often required a team of horses to accomodate the extra weight."

msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_HORSE_CART_MEDIUM_NAME"
msgstr "Horse Carriage"

msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_HORSE_CART_SMALL_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"In the early twentieth century, horse-drawn carts were the dominant form of "
