msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_HORSE_CART_SMALL_NAME"
msgstr "Small Horse Carriage"

msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_ISUZU_ELF_TLD20_TANK_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Outside Japan, this mid-sized truck from the sixties is also known as the "
"\"N-Series\". It was so popular that production continued well into the "
