msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_MACK_AC_STAKE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"The AC heavy-duty truck was a powerful and reliable workhorse. Its familiar "
"conically shaped hood eventually led to the creation of its nickname "
