"The C-type engine was a revolutionary design by Adolph Saurer AG in "
"Switzerland that was used as the basis for many types of trucks and busses."

msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_SAURER_C_TYP_UNIV_NAME"
msgstr "Saurer C Type"

msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_STEAM_LORRY_UNIV_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Originating in Masborough near Rotherham, UK, this early steam-powered lorry "
"design was employed by local industries such as coal mining and brewing."

msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_STEAM_LORRY_UNIV_NAME"
msgstr "Steam Truck"

msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_TESLA_SEMI_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Sporting three electric motors powering its two rear axles, this semi-truck "
"uses next-generation battery technology to enable long-range cargo transport."

msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_TESLA_SEMI_NAME"
msgstr "Tesla Semi"

msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_URBAN_ETRUCK_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"This fully electric truck designed and manufactured by Mercedes-Benz "
"features special aerodynamic features to maximize driving efficiency."

msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_URBAN_ETRUCK_NAME"
msgstr "Mercedes-Benz Urban eTruck"

msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_VOLVO_FH12_BULK_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"This Swedish truck is a powerful and reliable long-hauler popular for its "
"safety features and fuel efficiency, setting a standard in the trucking "
"industry."

msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_VOLVO_FH12_BULK_NAME"
msgstr "Volvo FH12 Bulk"

msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_VOLVO_FH12_TANK_DESCRIPTION"
