"This Swedish truck is a powerful and reliable long-hauler popular for its "
"safety features and fuel efficiency, setting a standard in the trucking "
"industry."

msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_VOLVO_FH12_TANK_NAME"
msgstr "Volvo FH12 Tank"

msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_ZIS_150_BULK_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Building on the experience Soviet vehicle manufacturers gained from adapting "
"early Ford models to their needs, they designed the ZIS as a more modern "
"allround truck."

msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_ZIS_150_BULK_NAME"
msgstr "ZIS-150 Bulk"

msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_ZIS_150_STAKE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Building on the experience Soviet vehicle manufacturers gained from adapting "
"early Ford models to their needs, they designed the ZIS as a more modern "
"allround truck."

msgid "VEHICLE_TRUCK_ZIS_150_STAKE_NAME"
msgstr "ZIS-150 Stake"

msgid "VEHICLE_WAGGON_BAY_05_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Being used for services with limited speed, this small Bavarian two-axle "
"passenger wagon had a wooden body with limited comfort for passengers."

msgid "VEHICLE_WAGGON_BAY_05_NAME"
msgstr "Bavarian Passenger Coach"

msgid "VEHICLE_WAGGON_BILEVEL_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
