msgid "VEHICLE_WAGGON_CHINA_TYPE_YZ_22_NAME"
msgstr "Chinese Type YZ 22"

msgid "VEHICLE_WAGGON_COMPARTMENT_CAR_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Consisting of several separate compartments with their own entrance doors "
"arranged on the long side, conductors had no easy access to all passengers."

msgid "VEHICLE_WAGGON_COMPARTMENT_CAR_NAME"
msgstr "Compartment Car"

msgid "VEHICLE_WAGGON_DONNERBUECHSE_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Lacking insulation, these all-steel German wagons were incredibly loud. This "
"earned them the famous nickname \"Donnerbüchse\" or \"Thunderbox\"."

msgid "VEHICLE_WAGGON_DONNERBUECHSE_NAME"
msgstr "German Donnerbuchse"

msgid "VEHICLE_WAGGON_EGOROV_20_2_DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""
"Manufactured in Leningrad, this four-axle car was originally used in regular "
